      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Confirming that VRCUrlInput is missing from the packaged VRCSDK3.dll in the Worlds package v3.0.6. \nI originally fixed this issue by importing the one from the VRSDK3-WORLD-2022.0527.22.48_Public.unitypackage, but have also confirmed that using the Reload SDK option does repair this. \nScreenshot of before/after \"Reload SDK\" with missing hook in DLC attached.",
